From d1af5aec51e0c5d8788ec092fc10937c42c1fa1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:40:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 25/61] multi-pip-multiview

Video picture-in-picture windows from several tabs at once, each new one
opening in the next free corner, and a chrome://multiview tab that tiles
up to four of them with a Send to Multiview button in the media menu.
Muted tabs keep their media session. This commit owns the content
WebContents delegate and observer hooks it adds; the print and permission
signals and the opener token in web_contents_impl.* ride here. The
EnableTabMuting preset entry rides in runtime-accessors and the WebUI
registration in browser-settings.
